WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:06.790
This is Code Canvas for the web. Paste code or open a local file to see
the result.

2
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:13.990
Start with the built-in example. Pause the animation, then tap again to
play it.

3
00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:22.990
Switch to Code, edit the label, and apply it. The change appears in
Preview.

4
00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:30.590
You can also import a local file. Here I'm opening a standalone SVG
illustration.

5
00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:39.190
Open, edit, and preview on your phone, too. No account; your files stay
in this browser.

6
00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:48.190
Export the file when you're done. The web and Android apps have
different features. Find both on the project page.
